project/dr-ak-jain-model-town/dr-ak-jain-model-town/51.avif\" alt=\"Interior project in Model Town, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Model Town Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-raj-gupta-gujranwala-town/mr-raj-gupta-gujranwala-town/106.avif\" alt=\"Interior work in Gujranwala Town, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Gujranwala Town Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Which architecture services do you offer in Pitampura?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Planning, elevations, working drawings and consultant coordination for builder floors, independent houses and commercial buildings in North and West Delhi.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can you plan a rebuild of an old Pitampura house?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Many older houses are being rebuilt as stilt-plus-floors. We plan parking, staircases and lifts and make sure each floor gets light and air.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Is it easy to meet your team during the project?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Our head office is at Netaji Subhash Place, so design reviews and material meetings can happen close to your site.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why combine architecture services with interior planning?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">When the building and the interiors are planned together, rooms are sized for the furniture you need and services are placed where they will be used.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Home Ready for the Next Generation</h2>\n            <p>A well-planned rebuild adds value, space and comfort for decades. Careful architecture services make sure the new building fits both the family and the plot.</p><p>Thinking of rebuilding in Pitampura? <a href=\"/pitampura/contact\">Book a plot study with 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}